        "contentOverrides": {
          "academics_chapter_content": "** Our Classes Offering\nAt CSEEL Global Education, we offer classes from ==class 1 to class 5== ([CBSE]), building strong foundations in languages, mathematics, scientific inquiry, and analytical problem-solving through continuous assessment and attentive classroom mentorship.\n\n** Streams and Subject Offerings\n## Science (Medical)\nIn the medical science stream, aspiring healthcare and life-sciences students study scientific principles and laboratory practice with subjects including **physics**, **chemistry**, **biology**, and **English core**.\n## Science (Non-Medical)\nIn the non-medical science stream, learners preparing for engineering, technology, and pure sciences explore quantitative concepts with subjects including **physics**, **chemistry**, **mathematics**, and **computer science**.\n## Commerce\nIn the commerce section, students develop financial literacy, commercial reasoning, and analytical decision-making with subjects including **accountancy**, **business studies**, **economics**, and **mathematics**.\n## Humanities / Arts\nIn humanities and arts, learners examine human society, governance, culture, and behavioral perspectives with subjects including **history**, **geography**, **political science**, and **psychology**.\n\n** Results Highlights\n==Outstanding 100% CBSE Board pass rate with multiple state toppers in STEM and Humanities.=="
        },
